---
title: Gravy
image: https://bakeitwithlove.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/pork-gravy-sq.jpg.webp
---

Mix @flour{1/4%cup} and @cold water{1/4%cup} to make a roux.

> This will _not_ mix easily, so try to find a way to make it smooth. I.E. putting in a tupperware with a tight lid and shaking until no lumps remain.

Combine @turkey drippings/juices{1%cup}(top fatty layer skimmed/separated for your stuffing) and roux in a #saucepan on medium heat. Stir constantly until the mixture thickens.

> If the mixture doesn't thicken, make/add more roux.

Add spices for fun and flavor to taste, i.e. @?oregano{} or other herbalicious materials.